{
  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-hUHgbEho\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UIlB33o2\">本章节主要介绍API上报线索流程及<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1794759460056076\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取本地推线索列表</a>与<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/37/docs/1805613694863499\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">线索回传</a>相关能力。</p></blockquote><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YdpH7%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-KXhBsiFm%5C%22%3E%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87API%E5%9B%9E%E4%BC%A0%E4%B8%8A%E6%8A%A5%E7%BA%BF%E7%B4%A2%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%B8%AE%E5%8A%A9%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E3%80%81%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E5%90%8E%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99%E6%9B%B4%E5%80%BE%E5%90%91%E4%BA%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%EF%BC%9BAPI%E5%9B%9E%E4%BC%A0%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%9B%9E%E4%BC%A0%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%B9%B6%E6%A0%87%E8%AE%B0%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%B9%9F%E5%B0%86%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%92%8C%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%B8%AE%E5%8A%A9%E6%82%A8%E6%8E%92%E6%9F%A5%E5%90%8E%E6%95%88%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KXhBsiFm\">通过API回传上报线索深度转化事件，可帮助优化投放、提高后效，推送给更倾向于发生转化行为的客户；API回传接口同时支持回传无效事件并标记无效类型标签，该数据也将用于模型优化和支持帮助您排查后效问题。</p></div></div></div><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-vPixlErZ\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-vPixlErZ\">API上报流程简介</h1><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-JBgMbc8C\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-JBgMbc8C\">1 完成投放前准备</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-nVxUHV3L\">在投放前，需要获得有效token，以便在投放后对线索进行及时的拉取、跟进和标记回传。获得有效token，需要在巨量引擎开放后台完成开发者注册并申请APPID应用，客户（投放账户advertiser_id）完成对APPID的投放账户授权后，使用授权后的auth_code换取有效token，APPID后续可使用对应的有效token进行接口调用。进行授权并获得token的方法参考<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710502277120\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">帮助文档</a>。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-PCwYiOJu\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/d5cc9bd015ba41f4b44da90f4f57baba~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2037352874&amp;x-signature=tloRlLnhGDmEUzlAqrwxIAQ%2Bkeo%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-Vjg0lVZl\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-fk7nI9Rt\">2 在本地推开始投放</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-6gYL9jbN\">完成投放准备后，可在本地推进行营销投放。</p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-AjI7bgl5\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-AjI7bgl5\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/3d1388016a884b54b022715e1b003c84~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2037352970&amp;x-signature=NkqSK66yC%2BTiVcBtItkBy%2F90krU%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></h2><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-9sv2fAeQ\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-9sv2fAeQ\">3 通过API回传线索</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-SK6YikPn\">开始投放后，可通过API进行留资线索的跟进和事件的回传，具体分为三步：通过接口进行线索拉取、对拉取线索进行跟进和事件标记、对标记有深转或无效事件的线索通过接口及时进行回传。</p><h3 id=\"h6f20189-EBS2OMc1\" data-id=\"h6f20189-EBS2OMc1\">3.1 拉取线索：</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-4knTB623\">通过接口请求将本地推营销投放数据拉取到自己的CRM平台中，进行后续的线索跟进和管理，接口请求方法参考文档：<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/37/docs/1794759460056076?origin=left_nav\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取本地推线索列表</a>。</p><h3 id=\"h6f20189-XjMVeLNO\" data-id=\"h6f20189-XjMVeLNO\">3.2 按规则处理线索：</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-pCZ4c1Tw\">为使投放模型可以更好地学习数据、进一步优化投放，需要根据线索跟进情况对线索进行标记，并通过在回传时对<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">clue_convert_state</code>字段进行相应赋值实现对线索的标记。目前支持回传以下类型事件。</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-id=\"ttcauzd34-z20vxw1wbls000\" data-custom=\"false\" class=\"data-table\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-f6f6fg03dio000\"><col width=\"17.4061433447099%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"cikzrv9uo-1er2imkl7glc000\"><col width=\"24.118316268486918%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"cikzrv9uo-xkcu2k4dank000\"><col width=\"58.47554038680318%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c1uwadb7k-2058w2qerlcw00\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-lzywmq6bjjk000\"><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-gx4eli2476w000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tw6z62h8g-5ik6280x8y0000\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-13dr3tjq8dnk000\">clue_convert_state</p></td><td data-id=\"tw6z62h8g-1glv4wzsdbcw000\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-26mhp5qux1mo00\">事件名称</p></td><td data-id=\"tbl8cvwbs-1bnzxqx0gnmo000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-jkyg0iu0m1s000\">事件含义</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-qhndivk34xs000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-10vriozzlqsg000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1i17m6t1zsn4000\">194</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-8k4t27gj4k8000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-95q192gy8is000\">顾客表达有意向</p></td><td data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-jpa70bm16q0000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-161rzetlmo8w000\">代表线索初步清洗和跟进后，确认留资顾客表达有意向，可进一步跟进</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-g93t2ifz5wo000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t58f1wo6w-rhs2nezfum8000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-137njdycvcts000\">196</p></td><td data-id=\"t58f1wo6w-mlpgbqqk67k000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-18h1k9vz6fts000\">定金或钩子品支付</p></td><td data-id=\"teoihb8ig-rbsay1dggjk000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-hsf4cnik034000\">代表顾客进行了支付定金或购买钩子品的行为</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-1e1n0ls6n540000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t58f1wo6w-oct45ykz6xs000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-d3u7oajt6l4000\">527</p></td><td data-id=\"t58f1wo6w-1bbvu9ej8dog000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-14jkxsdj82xs000\">顾客到店/销售人员上门</p></td><td data-id=\"teoihb8ig-500ci35jnok000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ro400lz30tc000\">代表顾客线下到店，或销售人员成功上门与顾客进行线下沟通</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-1e523i5q09gg000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t58f1wo6w-mejwby79abk000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1gdczi9mcerk00\">285</p></td><td data-id=\"t58f1wo6w-532ifdwab3s000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1d51yin2xl5s000\">正价支付</p></td><td data-id=\"teoihb8ig-1jorn3d9x8xs000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-191eq53r27ls000\">代表顾客以正常价格购买了非钩子品的商品或服务</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-177mm7z2x9a800\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t14oj2scg-1k5vsuqkqog0000\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-w488xldhb1s000\">10000</p></td><td data-id=\"t14oj2scg-9znd7b1ilyg000\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-whbamm791j4000\">无效事件</p></td><td data-id=\"tbata35h4-11aesgc88re8000\" class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-bau6aqhwq2g000\">代表线索跟进后，放弃或确认不会发生后续转化行为的无效线索</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-LSKHoEqL\">若您回传了无效事件，还需要使用<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">event_data</code>字段进行无效类型标记。全行业的客户可使用通用无效标签进行标记，家居建材行业的客户可以使用更为详细的无效标签进行标记，以便为您排查后效做出数据支持。</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-id=\"ttcauzd34-11qpbind629s000\" data-custom=\"false\" class=\"data-table\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-cscwq2v0u2g000\"><col width=\"17.861205915813425%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"cikyvqgns-h1402svdkfc000\"><col width=\"23.321956769055745%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"cikzrv9uo-1583ru2ny5kw000\"><col width=\"58.81683731513083%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"cikyvqgns-497gn7bso5i000\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-185bwhiqfq1s000\"><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-fpr46xwam00000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tw6z62h8g-v0375eydd80000\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-y6fjh9eui40000\">行业</p></td><td data-id=\"tw6z62h8g-4u2uwp3uc1o000\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-dckr44j6g9s000\">event_data</p></td><td data-id=\"tbl8cvwbs-1ihzmfz0vtuo000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1jm4o9fiwy0w000\">无效标签类型</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-1cjp396lkr34000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td rowspan=\"6\" data-id=\"t144xmvls-184yzjixik1s000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-kux6vk0zan4000\">通用</p></td><td data-id=\"tiq5bzl28-1gee6ru1upeo000\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1edmk52gn08w000\">0</p></td><td data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-1mchvt9a5bwg000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-zp1s6ru5mq8000\">其它</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-115vg0wacevk000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t58f1wo6w-1iy8mtsfp0u8000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1hfn5i3l6xls000\">1</p></td><td data-id=\"teoihb8ig-1keeqs655y74000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-33stterw8jo000\">拨打3次以上未接通</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-1h6283tdjn7k000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t58f1wo6w-zsp7y6tyjsg000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-olv1x5zqbf4000\">2</p></td><td data-id=\"teoihb8ig-1klgi2fqcra8000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1521q4xwvyxs000\">空号/停机/关机</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-1hocxj839qhs000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t58f1wo6w-5xhbhtld4io000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1ciomgbyf5og000\">3</p></td><td data-id=\"teoihb8ig-1ghpgxztu6xs000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1lzbsrg3d94w000\">反馈未在营销留资</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-j01j98daj28000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t58f1wo6w-16z7fr1rfee8000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-n4w2nn8s8m8000\">4</p></td><td data-id=\"teoihb8ig-6yh60i6doy4000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ra7bs515jkw000\">接通但无意向</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-1dltysebh8n4000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t58f1wo6w-ao2ek9l03k4000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-16wywjsmo8qk000\">5</p></td><td data-id=\"teoihb8ig-1113qqifm7cw000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-7q0n8cma0u4000\">黑脏词</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-owiqa5re2a8000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"t33hpvojc-sqb5p3c6r40000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-hqnb1om2g14000\">家居建材</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-cecfppwcsuw000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5y0bblfoz80000\">100</p></td><td data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-1d5cllicez8g000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1e0zgx146s74000\">需求不匹配-消费力差（指代预算少/面积小）</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-7uxo29ncv3w000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t14ojpqxs-1p4nviwf4p1c00\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-164te75seksg000\">101</p></td><td data-id=\"tuo4sw5og-bs4f0fzz6vk000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-who7rb1lwao000\">需求不匹配-需求与供给异地</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"h6f20189-jBAS3i2j\" data-id=\"h6f20189-jBAS3i2j\">3.3 回传数据</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-4gRrsdcd\">对线索进行跟进后，标记有深转事件或无效的线索请及时通过接口进行回传，供投放模型进行学习和优化。回传接口及方法参考文档：<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/37/docs/1805613694863499\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">线索回传</a>。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-hLshDspK\"><br></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-cg2xXMxn\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-cg2xXMxn\">4 通过来客平台查看回传数据</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-kZZOTEqf\">前往来客平台查看通过API回传的线索深转事件，功能规划中，敬请期待。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-5vJbGjdX\"><br></p></div>",
